- Story & Context: A young cartographer named Lena, driven by the whisper of the "Broadcast," found a tattered postcard beneath the skeletal antenna of an abandoned transmission tower, its ink bleeding in the rain, which detailed coordinates to a hidden bunker, but her compass needle spun wildly, signaling more than magnetic north. "The frequency shifts when the lightning strikes, just listen!"
